HST Office: Writer's "Công cụ" group in two rows, like every other Home group.

The group had its spelling and extensions buttons in rows 1 and 2 of the second column and its
caption in row 3, so it needed 129 px where the other groups need 120: Writer's ribbon was 9 px
taller than Sheets' and its banner sat 4 px lower. The two buttons move up to rows 0 and 1 and the
caption to row 2; Writer's ribbon becomes as tall as the others.

